# Konquista App – Tech Stack & Project Overview

## Core Technologies
- **Language:** Python 3.10+
- **Web Framework:** Django (latest stable, e.g., 4.x)
- **API:** GraphQL (flexible data querying/mutation)
- **Containerization:** Docker & Docker Compose  
  - **Containers:** Django, Celery worker, Celery beat, Redis, PostgreSQL, Nginx, Monitoring

## System Architecture
- **Backend:** Django + Celery + Redis stack
- **Database:** PostgreSQL (production), SQLite (dev/test)
- **Caching:** Redis
- **Task Queue:** Celery (asynchronous processing, multi-queue)
- **Reverse Proxy:** Nginx
- **Monitoring:** Integrated logging & error tracking

## Core Features
- **Intelligent Message Management:**  
  Campaign scheduling, smart targeting, dynamic content, parallel processing, file/media support
- **CRM Integration (apiCrm):**  
  Real-time bi-directional sync, automated lead management, appointment/payment handling
- **Message Shooter System:**  
  Campaign engine, dynamic target lists, async queue processing, rate limiting, error handling
- **Core System:**  
  Contact management, message templates, user/role management, WhatsApp number management, activity logging

## Development Workflow
- **Version Control:** Git
- **Dependency Management:** pip, requirements.txt
- **Testing:** Pytest (unit, integration, coverage, mocking)
- **Container Orchestration:** docker-compose

## Setup & Deployment
**Prerequisites:** Python 3.10+, Docker & Docker Compose, Redis, PostgreSQL (optional for local)

**Local Development:**
```bash
pip install -r requirements.txt
python manage.py runserver
celery -A konquist worker -l INFO -Q default,contact_processor,campaign_queue,queue_processor
celery -A konquist beat -l INFO